      "cooked": "<p>It seems in recent versions of ERPNext and Frappe the Desktop Customization Button has been removed. Also I can no longer find System Console.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/9/292a83325a0ec212f46b4c8f48ede794bcbf6bf4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/292a83325a0ec212f46b4c8f48ede794bcbf6bf4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/9/292a83325a0ec212f46b4c8f48ede794bcbf6bf4_2_690x336.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5SaEQHC1QGIk5vlmfRQtVT1ixgM\" width=\"690\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/9/292a83325a0ec212f46b4c8f48ede794bcbf6bf4_2_690x336.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/9/292a83325a0ec212f46b4c8f48ede794bcbf6bf4_2_1035x504.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/9/292a83325a0ec212f46b4c8f48ede794bcbf6bf4_2_1380x672.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"181B1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1915×935 26.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>System Console:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/d/fd7e4ae3012bd911ffd5830cf63fddc313d4ff53.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fd7e4ae3012bd911ffd5830cf63fddc313d4ff53\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/d/fd7e4ae3012bd911ffd5830cf63fddc313d4ff53_2_690x222.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"AavnAGYUnWAIntP6MN0NIsyLQwr\" width=\"690\" height=\"222\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/d/fd7e4ae3012bd911ffd5830cf63fddc313d4ff53_2_690x222.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/d/fd7e4ae3012bd911ffd5830cf63fddc313d4ff53_2_1035x333.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/d/fd7e4ae3012bd911ffd5830cf63fddc313d4ff53_2_1380x444.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"212221\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1773×571 43.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"json\"><code class=\"lang-json\">{\n\t\"frappe\": \"16.12.0\",\n\t\"erpnext\": \"16.10.0\",\n\t\"hrms\": \"16.4.3\",\n\t\"telephony\": \"0.0.1\",\n\t\"helpdesk\": \"1.21.3\",\n\t\"offsite_backups\": \"0.0.1\",\n\t\"print_designer\": \"1.6.7\"\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>How can I resolve it? Right now there is simply no way to customize the desktop icons.</p>",
