      "created_at": "2026-03-18T08:50:30.651Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After right click, Edit Layout button appears:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e4be680c920f4ea74b2bdeded7dcd92c21a3d4d0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e4be680c920f4ea74b2bdeded7dcd92c21a3d4d0\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e4be680c920f4ea74b2bdeded7dcd92c21a3d4d0_2_690x204.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wDyO2OcxhVxXjDxTjjPk9RLSoHC\" width=\"690\" height=\"204\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e4be680c920f4ea74b2bdeded7dcd92c21a3d4d0_2_690x204.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e4be680c920f4ea74b2bdeded7dcd92c21a3d4d0_2_1035x306.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e4be680c920f4ea74b2bdeded7dcd92c21a3d4d0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B2327\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1216×361 18.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>There is no way to know if this even exists.</p>",
