      "created_at": "2026-03-19T14:21:54.203Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Regarding the system console: I suspect it’s permission-based. I can see it using the Administrator account but not from my regular account even though it has the System Manager role. I’m not 100% sure if it was like that in v15.</p>\n<p>Once you do have access to the console: one neat trick I noticed is that you can use Shift-T to bring it up instantly as a pop-up in any workspace, instead of having to open the System Console page.</p>",
